🧡GIVEAWAY🧡

We teamed up with some of our favorite brands you can find at @target to fill your pantry for this season! One lucky winner gets this fabulous bundle of goodies plus a $200 @target giftcard!

How to enter✨
- Follow all the participating brands:
@heydaycanningco
@getsauz
@onetrickponynuts
@getgraza
@flybyjing
@eatbanza
@little.latke
- Like this post & add to your story
- Tag who you’re cooking for this cozy season, and tell us the dish you’d make them!

The giveaway closes Sunday, November 15 at 11:59 PM PT. The winner will be chosen at random and contacted personally with a DM from @heydaycanningco on Monday, November 16.
Open to U.S. residents 18+. Only @heydaycanning will contact the winner, so watch out for fake accounts. We’ll never ask for payment or passwords. This giveaway is not sponsored, endorsed or administered by Instagram or Meta.
